/Title (SpotFixAI solves the problem of slow, fragmented, and inefficient civic issue reporting such as potholes, garbage, drainage, and broken streetlights. Citizens and municipal authorities both face this issue due to manual reporting, duplicate complaints, poor prioritization, and lack of transparent tracking. It is important because unresolved civic problems can affect public safety, cleanliness, and quality of life. SpotFixAI addresses these gaps using AI-based prioritization, duplicate detection, location-based reporting, and real-time complaint tracking.)
